=== Expense Report Analyzer ===

# Expense Report Analysis

## 1. Category Breakdown & Spending Patterns

| Category | Amount | % of Total | Count |
|----------|--------|-----------|-------|
| Travel | $290.50 | 54.2% | 2 items |
| Meals | $89.20 | 16.6% | 1 item |
| Office Supplies | $156.75 | 29.2% | 1 item |
| **Total** | **$536.45** | **100%** | **4 items** |

**Pattern Notes:**
- Travel dominates spending (conference-related trip)
- Concentrated 4-day expense period (likely single business trip)
- Mixed expense types suggest multi-purpose business travel

---

## 2. Policy Compliance Check

✅ **COMPLIANT ITEMS:**
- Flight ($245.50) - reasonable for conference travel
- Taxi ($45.00) - appropriate ground transportation
- Client dinner ($89.20) - legitimate business meal

⚠️ **REQUIRES VERIFICATION:**
- **Office Supplies ($156.75)** - *Needs clarification*
  - Amount is substantial for "supplies"
  - Timing during travel trip is unusual
  - Confirm: Is this equipment or consumables?


